    /// <summary>منبع اصلی: خواندن قطعات از جدول‌های مجزا (entity ها) — fallback: JSON رکوردهای قدیمی.</summary>
    private async Task LoadHwFromTables()
    {
        hw = null;
        try
        {
            var c = await Http.GetFromJsonAsync<ComponentsDto>($"/api/SystemInfo/{Id}/components");
            if (c != null &&
                (c.Cpus.Count + c.Rams.Count + c.Disks.Count + c.Gpus.Count + c.Monitors.Count +
                 c.NetAdapters.Count + c.Volumes.Count + (c.Board != null ? 1 : 0)) > 0)
            {
                hw = new HardwareDetails
                {
                    Board = c.Board?.Board,
                    BoardSerial = c.Board?.BoardSerial,
                    ComputerModel = c.Board?.ComputerModel,
                    Cpus = c.Cpus.Select(x => new CpuDetail { Name = x.Name, Cores = x.Cores, Threads = x.Threads, ClockGhz = x.ClockGhz }).ToList(),
                    RamSticks = c.Rams.Select(x => new RamStickDetail { Slot = x.Slot, CapacityGb = x.CapacityGb, Type = x.Type, SpeedMhz = x.SpeedMhz, Manufacturer = x.Manufacturer, PartNumber = x.PartNumber, SerialNumber = x.SerialNumber }).ToList(),
                    Disks = c.Disks.Select(x => new DiskDetail { Model = x.Model, SizeGb = x.SizeGb, Interface = x.Interface, SerialNumber = x.SerialNumber, SmartStatus = x.SmartStatus }).ToList(),
                    Gpus = c.Gpus.Select(x => new GpuDetail { Name = x.Name, Resolution = x.Resolution }).ToList(),
                    Monitors = c.Monitors.Select(x => new MonitorDetail { Name = x.Name, Resolution = x.Resolution, SerialNumber = x.SerialNumber, IsPrimary = x.IsPrimary }).ToList(),
                    NetAdapters = c.NetAdapters.Select(x => new NetAdapterDetail { Name = x.Name, Description = x.Description, Type = x.Type, MacAddress = x.MacAddress, Ipv4 = x.Ipv4, Gateway = x.Gateway }).ToList(),
                    Volumes = c.Volumes.Select(x => new VolumeDetail { Letter = x.Letter, Label = x.Label, TotalGb = x.TotalGb, UsedGb = x.UsedGb }).ToList()
                };
                return; // از جدول‌ها خوانده شد
            }
        }
        catch { }
        ParseHw(); // رکورد قدیمی — از JSON
    }

    private void ParseHw()
    {
        hw = null;
        if (item != null && !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(item.DetailsJson))
        {
            try { hw = System.Text.Json.JsonSerializer.Deserialize<HardwareDetails>(item.DetailsJson, new System.Text.Json.JsonSerializerOptions { PropertyNameCaseInsensitive = true }); }
            catch { }
        }
    }

